?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-05T15:57:37-08:00","id":1438188,"title":"","content":"wanting to join a sect so you can destroy it? Proud that you're more threatening to the people with the high ground that outnumber you at least twenty to one than they are a threat to you? I'm sorry, maybe I didnt read the rules well enough: do Lasombra now have a discipline that strengthens them by their own conceit?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-05T16:07:12-08:00","id":1438190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1437660-5e-the-clan-updates?p=1438188#post1438188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">wanting to join a sect so you can destroy it? Proud that you're more threatening to the people with the high ground that outnumber you at least twenty to one than they are a threat to you? I'm sorry, maybe I didnt read the rules well enough: do Lasombra now have a discipline that strengthens them by their own conceit?</div> </div> </div> </div>And why the Lasombra are so awesome?<br /> <br /> They got their enemies to WELCOME them, through the front door no less.<br /> <br /> The question is, &quot;Do you believe the Lasombra are awesome enough to become co-rulers of the Camarilla within a few decades?&quot;<br /> <br /> I do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-05T16:23:18-08:00","id":1438197,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1437660-5e-the-clan-updates?p=1438190#post1438190\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They got their enemies to WELCOME them, through the front door no less.</div> </div> </div> </div> more like through the dog flap","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25992-archderd","name":"archderd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-05T22:42:18-08:00","id":1438256,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1437660-5e-the-clan-updates?p=1437818#post1437818\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If a vampire doesn't have to feed on people and isn't a danger to regular humans, it's not a vampire.<br /> <br /> That's the problem of the Salubri.<br /> <br /> If you don't care about the humans you feed on, you're not doing it right either...or it's a Sabbat game.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Gangrel and Nos animal eaters say hi.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1437660-5e-the-clan-updates?p=1438190#post1438190\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And why the Lasombra are so awesome?<br /> <br /> They got their enemies to WELCOME them, through the front door no less.<br /> <br /> The question is, &quot;Do you believe the Lasombra are awesome enough to become co-rulers of the Camarilla within a few decades?&quot;<br /> <br /> I do.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> you mean on their knees after abandoning their power and influence in the biggest case of plot induced stupidity to occur in WoD history, rivalled only by the gehenna crusade, or turning the Tzimisce into a racist anti-slav victorian panic piece, (If as you claim Bram Stoker didn't mean it to be racist, he was massively incompetent because he played into the same ones that had existed for decades), and removing the mad scientist and transhumanist aspects, as well as the lack of mind control that made that clan make sense, now they are just weird Ventrue, with everything interesting crushed out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 03-06-2021, 01:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-05T22:56:37-08:00","id":1438261,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>archderd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1437660-5e-the-clan-updates?p=1438197#post1438197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> more like through the dog flap</div> </div> </div> </div>Note: The Sheriff and Scourges of LA are Lasombra. There's also potentially a Primogen of New York., They're doing well for themselves.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1437660-5e-the-clan-updates?p=1438256#post1438256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">you mean on their knees after abandoning their power and influence in the biggest case of plot induced stupidity to occur in WoD history, rivalled only by the gehenna crusade, or turning the Tzimisce into a racist anti-slav victorian panic piece, (If as you claim Bram Stoker didn't mean it to be racist, he was massively incompetent because he played into the same ones that had existed for decades), and removing the mad scientist and transhumanist aspects, as well as the lack of mind control that made that clan make sense, now they are just weird Ventrue, with everything interesting crushed out.</div> </div> </div> </div>1. The Sabbat was a sinking ship.<br /> <br /> 2. Try reading THE POWERS OF DARKNESS where Bram Stoker rewrote large sections of the novel and used more chapters that make it clear Dracula is running a pan-vampiric ring of German proto-fascists that will rise through Norway and England to conquer the world.<br /> <br /> 3. The new Tzimisce aren't Slavic at all. So you should be happy about that element.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 03-06-2021, 01:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-05T23:16:32-08:00","id":1438270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1437660-5e-the-clan-updates?p=1438261#post1438261\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Note: The Sheriff and Scourges of LA are Lasombra. There's also potentially a Primogen of New York., They're doing well for themselves.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> 1. The Sabbat was a sinking ship.<br /> <br /> 2. Try reading THE POWERS OF DARKNESS where Bram Stoker rewrote large sections of the novel and used more chapters that make it clear Dracula is running a pan-vampiric ring of German proto-fascists that will rise through Norway and England to conquer the world.<br /> <br /> 3. The new Tzimisce aren't Slavic at all. So you should be happy about that element.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 1. No it was turned into one for V5. (Or maybe by BJD, as I literally cannot read that book, it is possible that it was setup there) <br /> <br /> 2. I'll try to find it.<br /> <br /> 3. That is like claiming old Ravnos weren't gypsies, as in technically true but actually inaccurate","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T00:53:21-08:00","id":1438277,"title":"","content":"Some of these changes are actually an improvement, at least in my opinion, but then become more questionable when looked at in the context of the traditional setting.<br /> <br /> It makes sense for the Lasombra to be in the Camarilla, but having so many defect in such a way and their current position in the Camarilla - suddenly it seems weird. The same goes for the Hecate and Giovanni. It would have made sense for the Giovanni to be a bloodline within the Clan of Death, but suddenly all of the Capoadocian based bloodlines joining together in one Sect/Clan/whatever as the Giovanni become a bloodline now seems implausible. The same goes for a number of Sect changing Clans in this edition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T00:56:16-08:00","id":1438278,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sergeant Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1437660-5e-the-clan-updates?p=1438277#post1438277\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some of these changes are actually an improvement, at least in my opinion, but then become more questionable when looked at in the context of the traditional setting.<br /> <br /> It makes sense for the Lasombra to be in the Camarilla, but having so many defect in such a way and their current position in the Camarilla - suddenly it seems weird. The same goes for the Hecate and Giovanni. It would have made sense for the Giovanni to be a bloodline within the Clan of Death, but suddenly all of the Capoadocian based bloodlines joining together in one Sect/Clan/whatever as the Giovanni become a bloodline now seems implausible. The same goes for a number of Sect changing Clans in this edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>One thing that seemed weird, the Hecata are supposed to be the Cappadocians reborn...so why do they have the Giovanni clan flaw?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T01:40:09-08:00","id":1438279,"title":"","content":"The Hecata is just... Gah fuck. <br /> Incestuous families which summon the dead and have vampires in them are cool. <br /> Samedi are just... I'm keen to diversify them so they aren't all Caribrean stereotypes, but they are very cool. <br /> The Flesh eaters I always forget the spelling of (not the dunsirn, the Nagajara, or Najagara, or naragaragaja; Do I pronounces the J like a Y like most languages do or should I stick with an english J or maybe go spanish with a h...) They're pretty cool. <br /> The Capadocians, honestly, cool spread, little bit boring. The Harbringers are cool but a little bit too exotic. <br /> <br /> What've we got here, Auspex, Obfuscate, Potence, Fortitude, Dominate, Protean (Thanatosis), Necromancy of so many different flavours... a cornicopia of interesting and contrasting discipline spreads and weaknesses and cultural backgrounds...<br /> Anyway, we take all these diverse and mostly-cool bloodlines and we put them all into a pot and we melt them together into a bland soup necromancer for simplicity.... <br /> <br /> How did anyone allow this to happen?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T02:29:46-08:00","id":1438282,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the Hecata are a hot mess. No clue what they were thinking. They should have been their own separate sub-faction, insofar as you have different vampires from different clans, some of whom share a common ancestry, forming an alliance and working together.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T03:39:24-08:00","id":1438286,"title":"","content":"I'd rather see, hmmm...<br /> I know the names of some prominent Giovanni families, but I don't know which way they'd swing, so I'll make a few up.<br /> <br /> The Smith family serve the Camarilla<br /> The Williams family serve the Sabbat<br /> The White Family serve the Camarilla<br /> The Yang family serve both<br /> The Collins family are nominally a part of the Anarchs.<br /> The Achebe family serve the cam.<br /> The Green family serve themselves<br /> The Orange family serve whoever's dominant in Texas.<br /> The Black Family are sponsored by the Ventrue. <br /> <br /> ...and so on and so forth. The same may be true for different lineages of Harbringers of skulls.<br /> The Samedi work through the Nosferatu.<br /> The flesh eaters work through whatever works for them, many of them probably also work through the nosferatu","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T05:50:44-08:00","id":1438298,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1437660-5e-the-clan-updates?p=1438270#post1438270\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1. No it was turned into one for V5. (Or maybe by BJD, as I literally cannot read that book, it is possible that it was setup there)<br /> <br /> 2. I'll try to find it.<br /> <br /> 3. That is like claiming old Ravnos weren't gypsies, as in technically true but actually inaccurate</div> </div> </div> </div>1. You're correct that the Sabbat was in a bad place but the total collapse of the sect (or more precisely it taking a lot of blows) before going off to the Middle East is a product of V5. The BJD take on the subject is that the sect has yet another Civil War but not something that results in it effectively disappearing from the game. Thankfully, and note that the Sabbat is my second favorite sect, they're getting the book this year that they should have gotten from the beginning.<br /> <br /> The releases should have been:<br /> <br /> VAMPIRE: THE MASQUERADE<br /> THE ANARCH<br /> THE CAMARILLA<br /> THE SABBAT<br /> THE SECOND INQUISITION<br /> <br /> 2. Even without the Powers of Darkness, there's also the missing opening chapter of Dracula where Jonathan Harker is still in Western Europe (Munich to be precise) when he stupidly goes on an exploration of old cemetaries and almost ends up devoured by a female vampire before Dracula (using his ability to see vast distances) sends a lightning bolt to stop her. This was published as DRACULA'S GUEST.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Powers_of_Darkness\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/Title_page_of_M%C3%B6rkets_Makter_from_Dagen.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Powers_of_Darkness\" target=\"_blank\"> Powers of Darkness - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Powers_of_Darkness\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Powers_of_Darkness </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dracula%27s_Guest\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Dracula%27s_Guest_and_Other_Weird_Stories_%281914%29.jpg/960px-Dracula%27s_Guest_and_Other_Weird_Stories_%281914%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dracula%27s_Guest\" target=\"_blank\"> Dracula's Guest - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dracula%27s_Guest\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dracula%27s_Guest </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> 3. The problem with the Tzimisce is they're a malicious bunch of vile monsters that any location they're in seems like libel. The new Tzimisce show their better qualities far greater an